{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreData","doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreData\/NSManagedObjectContext"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"isEnsemblesIntegrationContext","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:So22NSManagedObjectContextC9EnsemblesE02isd11IntegrationC0Sbvp","modules":[{"relatedModules":["CoreData"],"name":"Ensembles"}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"CoreData","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEnsemblesIntegrationContext","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreData\/NSManagedObjectContext\/isEnsemblesIntegrationContext","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when this context is the one Ensembles uses to insert and update objects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while integrating synced changes from other devices."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isEnsemblesIntegrationContext"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Core Data calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"awakeFromInsert()"},{"type":"text","text":" (and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"awakeFromFetch()"},{"type":"text","text":") on objects that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"typ